  "simplified": [
    "Opaque shaped roof sections replace the glass panes. The central palm house, matching wings and end pavilions retain their separate profiles.",
    "Only the large roof ribs, lanterns and the main entrance appear. Rear service spaces use low solids.",
    "Eight broad ribs suggest the radial dome framing. The entrance has a stepped front and recessed arched door. End roof ribs are grouped into five bands per pavilion.",
    "Eight grouped uprights define the raised glazed drum. Recessed panels suggest the lower wall glazing; the porch front reaches ground across its full width."
  ],
